import ../../site/games/farm/scene_areas.dl
import ../../site/games/farm/scene_landscape.dl

set world to the initial website farm world
set landscape to a website Farm landscape for world
set count to the length of landscape's objects
set areas to website Farm areas in landscape
set area to a new website farm area
set area's id to "orchard"
set area's name to "Orchard"
set area's color to "#609eaf"
set area's left to 6
set area's top to 7
set area's right to 7
set area's bottom to 8
append area to world's areas
ignore (update website Farm areas areas from world)
set entry to the item at 0 in (areas's saved)
require condition (((the length of entry's cells) = 4) and ((the length of entry's object's instance's model's parts) = 16)) reporting "A two-by-two Farm area needs one fill per tile and only its eight outside edges"
set model to entry's object's instance's model's parts' data
refresh UI scene instance (entry's object's instance)
require condition ((update website Farm areas areas from world) = false) reporting "Unchanged Farm areas must retain their models and poses"
require condition (entry's object's instance's model's parts' data = model) reporting "An unchanged area rebuilt its geometry"
set cell to the item at 0 in (entry's cells)
set tile to the website farm square at (cell's x) (cell's y) in world
set tile's terrain to 2
set pose to the item at (cell's part) in (entry's object's instance's poses)
set height to pose's position's y
require condition (update website Farm areas areas from world) reporting "Digging a channel must update the area's ground-following overlay"
set pose to the item at (cell's part) in (entry's object's instance's poses)
require condition ((the absolute value of ((height - pose's position's y) - 0.16)) < 0.000001) reporting "Area overlays must follow the lowered channel elevation"
show website Farm area preview area valid true in areas from world
set preview to areas's preview
set fill to the item at 1 in (preview's object's instance's materials)
require condition ((fill's unlit) and ((fill's opacity = 0.3) and (fill's depth write = false))) reporting "Area previews require translucent unlit fills without depth writes"
require condition ((fill's color's red = 115) and (fill's color's green = 148)) reporting "Valid area previews have the wrong confirmation color"
show website Farm area preview area valid false in areas from world
set fill to the item at 1 in (preview's object's instance's materials)
require condition ((fill's color's red = 202) and (fill's color's green = 89)) reporting "Invalid area previews have the wrong rejection color"
hide website Farm area preview in areas
clear world's areas
ignore (update website Farm areas areas from world)
require condition (((the length of areas's saved) = 0) and ((the length of landscape's objects) = count)) reporting "Removed area overlays left scene objects behind"
close website Farm areas areas
close website Farm landscape landscape
free website farm world world
print line "Farm area overlays retain unchanged geometry, follow terrain, draw only outside edges and own their previews."
